    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch07-08: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.44";
    dc:description "A selected generator corpus can test a proxy correlation, but the proposed implication is vague and selection-sensitive. Existing tests cannot establish the absence of all deviations, so only restricted versions are resolvable.";
