    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Define mathematical amenability using prespecified proof or complexity indicators and randomness by held-out statistical and compression tests, then compare a registered sample of generators. A lack of association or analytically tractable generator passing all strong tests would challenge the tendency.";
