    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Amenability to analysis has no objective scale.", "Every deterministic finite generator has some mathematical description.", "Failure to detect deviation is not perfect randomness.";
